<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sneak</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Assassin (guild level 0), Thief (guild level 1), Ranger (guild level 1, up to 75%)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>sneak
sneak      (again, to stop)
</pre>
<p>You move silently: while you sneak, others in a room don't see you arrive 
or leave, though anyone who looks around still sees you standing there. 
To vanish from sight as well, hide (see <a cmd='#'>Help Hide</a>): a thief who both 
sneaks and hides can come and go unseen.
</p><p>Your skill decides it, with your dexterity and brain. If you fail, you 
know it: you "make a feeble attempt to move silently", and so do those 
who watch you. If you succeed, you sneak about unnoticed for a while, 
longer the better you did. <a cmd='#'>score</a> tells you when you are sneaking.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hide</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Score</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Thief Skills</a>
</pre>




</div>